Crom
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
IWI 7 FACE_LAST
IWI 10 FACE_LAST
IWI 4 FACE_LAST
IWI 5 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE IWI IWI
DESTSRC Rank equal
MOVE_STACK IWI IWI
OR
    AND
        DEST Size < 0
        DEST Empty
    DESTSRC Rank descending
$win
OR
    PILE ALL IWI Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL IWI Empty
        PILE ALL IWI Empty
